{
  "description": "This staff has 10 charges. While holding it, you can expend 1 charge (Magic action) to cast Charm Person, Command, or Comprehend Languages using your spell save DC. If you succeed on a saving throw against an Enchantment spell that targets only you, you can take a Reaction to expend 1 charge and turn the spell back on its caster as if you had cast it. [Resist Enchantment omitted: requires a missing 'convert_failed_save_to_success' atom.] The staff regains 1d8+2 expended charges daily at dawn. If you expend the last charge, roll 1d20. On a 1, the staff crumbles to dust and is destroyed.",
